WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:09.509
Kennarar (teachers): one tab per
teacher of the course.

2
00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:13.511
The tick: teaches the course
this year.

3
00:00:13.611 --> 00:00:19.512
Kennir eftirfarandi tíma: which
sessions, and of what type.

4
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:25.514
With no session selected, a tick
is for the whole course.

5
00:00:25.614 --> 00:00:31.516
Select a session in the calendar:
the ticks are then for it alone.

6
00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:37.518
PE joins this dæmatími – the
other sessions stay as they were.

7
00:00:37.618 --> 00:00:42.519
One click on empty space: back
to the whole course.

8
00:00:42.619 --> 00:00:48.521
Athugasemdir kennara: what the
teacher wrote – read only.

9
00:00:48.621 --> 00:00:54.523
Óskatímar: one click = busy (red),
for all of the teacher's sessions.

10
00:00:54.623 --> 00:00:58.524
Two clicks = wanted (green).

11
00:00:58.624 --> 00:01:03.526
Kennir vikur: the weeks this
teacher teaches.

12
00:01:03.626 --> 00:01:09.528
Stofuóskir: one click = used last
(yellow), two = wanted (green).

13
00:01:09.628 --> 00:01:15.255
Athugasemd stjórnanda: the
admin's own note.

14
00:01:15.355 --> 00:01:21.256
Every change waits here – Staðfesta
og vista saves it all at once.

15
00:01:21.356 --> 00:01:27.258
Or Afgreiða athugasemdir: saves the
teachers and closes their answers.

16
00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:33.258
The wishes now sit in each
session's Stillingar, for Besta.
